    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0298",
      "reading_order": 351,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 35.98199999999997,
        "t": 241.38901953124991,
        "r": 560.205,
        "b": 208.70433441674618
      },
      "content": "When the appliance is not connected to an equipotential bonding system, there is a risk of electric shock from touching live parts. When the covers of the microwave combination oven are removed, there is a risk of electric shock from touching live parts.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0299",
      "reading_order": 352,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.98199999999998,
        "t": 204.91201953124994,
        "r": 560.1446999999994,
        "b": 184.22433441674616
      },
      "content": " Make sure that any work on the electrical system is performed solely by a qualified electrician from an authorized customer service office.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0300",
      "reading_order": 353,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.98199999999996,
        "t": 179.82901953124997,
        "r": 174.27599999999995,
        "b": 171.7413344167461
      },
      "content": "Before removing the covers:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0301",
      "reading_order": 354,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.972999999999956,
        "t": 168.19201953125003,
        "r": 365.79599999999994,
        "b": 159.74433441674614
      },
      "content": " Switch the appliance off and disconnect the plug from the wall socket.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0302",
      "reading_order": 355,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.972999999999956,
        "t": 155.70901953124996,
        "r": 394.4699999999999,
        "b": 147.2613344167462
      },
      "content": " Turn off the isolator switch to disconnect fixed wired appliances and lock-off.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0303",
      "reading_order": 356,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.972999999999956,
        "t": 143.46901953124996,
        "r": 505.58399999999995,
        "b": 135.02133441674619
      },
      "content": " Take protective measures at every power switch to ensure that the power cannot be switched on again.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0304",
      "reading_order": 357,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.96399999999994,
        "t": 131.47201953125,
        "r": 523.1970000000001,
        "b": 110.66733441674614
      },
      "content": " Always discharge the high voltage capacitors before working on the appliance using a  suitable Capacitor Discharge Tool, see section 2.15 'Process for discharging the capacitors'.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0305",
      "reading_order": 358,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.946000000000026,
        "t": 106.75801953124994,
        "r": 264.23999999999995,
        "b": 98.31033441674617
      },
      "content": " Make sure that the appliance is de-energized.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0306",
      "reading_order": 359,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99999999999997,
        "t": 94.74301953124996,
        "r": 523.026,
        "b": 74.05833441674622
      },
      "content": " Make sure that the electrical connections are intact, secure and all equipment panels are re-fitted before you reconnect the appliance to the power supply",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_350",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_2",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_2",
          "title": "2 For your safety"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_350",
          "title": "Risk of electric shock from live parts"
        }
      ],
      "page": 20,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0307",
      "reading_order": 360,
      "section": "Risk of electric shock from live parts",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.01799999999989,
        "t": 70.14901953125002,
        "r": 558.5489999999999,
        "b": 49.46133441674624
      },
      "content": " Before putting the appliance back into operation, make sure that the appliance, including all metallic accessories, is connected to an equipotential bonding system.",
